[{"title":"赠温幕张子常有诗见怀用韵因成五篇 其五","author":"华镇","text":"曾乘碧海驭风舟，几挹苍崖喷雪流。\n想得更当和鼎重，也应须记赏心幽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56166,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和河南府倅程朝散缑氏僧舍题壁","author":"华镇","text":"尘机不动有馀清，逸静孤飞在杳冥。\n想得马头无限思，碧云随处见瑶屏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56167,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宣化道上望钟山","author":"华镇","text":"望外江山千万重，北山秀气冠江东。\n可怜秋月澄明夜，怨鹤长悲蕙帐空。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56168,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题画","author":"华镇","text":"栽松累石状孱颜，万仞形容数尺间。\n会得秋毫非至细，可能留意羡他山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56169,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"阴影","author":"华镇","text":"升时冉冉落如飞，乌兔由来不自持。\n莫作人间天上语，有中都是一成亏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56170,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"出南薰门道中诗","author":"华镇","text":"玉津槐柳绿成阴，归路春光步步深。\n名宦未多年不少，到家聊缓北堂心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56171,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和刘叔怀见寄三绝句 其一","author":"华镇","text":"风前双鹤舞金衣，来送新诗过竹扉。\n逸响琤瑽鸣玉脆，雕章飘绝朵云飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56172,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和刘叔怀见寄三绝句 其二","author":"华镇","text":"冥冥心地外参寥，淅淅松梢挂饮瓢。\n挥麈纵衡忘孔墨，寄声邂逅得刘萧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56173,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和刘叔怀见寄三绝句 其三","author":"华镇","text":"清世儒冠不贱贫，一竿谁复钓溪滨。\n看君双鬓春条绿，策足应须据要津。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56174,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂咏 其一","author":"华镇","text":"不言藻绘文章恶，也识膏粱气味珍。\n春夏已休秋欲晚，明眸开口羡他人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56175,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂咏 其二","author":"华镇","text":"自是不耕仍不种，年来何处觅仓箱。\n秋冬莫遣还虚过，图取前春有稻粱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56176,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂咏 其三","author":"华镇","text":"秀色丰融凝晓露，新声睍睆弄东风。\n芳条已密无寻处，粉堞虽低径不通。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56177,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂咏 其四","author":"华镇","text":"莺老阴浓昼景迟，园林又是过芳时。\n香腮粉蕊年年好，只羡游蜂野蝶知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56178,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂咏 其五","author":"华镇","text":"兰膏不御鬓云垂，紫玉拈来懒自吹。\n西望阳关何处是，寂寥空度杏花时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56179,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂咏 其六","author":"华镇","text":"蓬鬓荆钗畎垄头，玉颜鸡狗分同游。\n眼前不见昭阳殿，谁复将心望冕旒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56180,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂咏 其七","author":"华镇","text":"芳年未识五云车，皓腕空留绛缕纱。\n燕子将雏莺语老，东风又是落宫花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56181,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂咏 其八","author":"华镇","text":"馺遝鸣驺里巷喧，殷勤来觅孝廉船。\n千年亲见风流事，不是空闻旧史传。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56182,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂咏 其九","author":"华镇","text":"亲屈朱轓接晤言，不惭长吉赋华轩。\n羽毛果是冲天物，愿借扶摇上九门。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56183,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"苦竹城","author":"华镇","text":"一叶扁舟激浪花，当时儿女亦惊嗟。\n归来苦竹城池就，始觉忘家是保家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56184,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"历阳试院闻角","author":"华镇","text":"英雄颠沛亦风流，长啸寒生画角愁。\n今日江城朝暮引，空教鸥鹭起沙头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56185,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"试院初闻蟋蟀","author":"华镇","text":"窗前落尽梧桐叶，床下新闻蟋蟀声。\n瘦骨不禁秋气重，夜深虚幌梦魂清。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56186,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过永城寄知县陈宣德同年三绝句 其一","author":"华镇","text":"惜别欣逢一纪馀，世途惟我最差池。\n当时侠少无年少，今日青丝有白丝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56187,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过永城寄知县陈宣德同年三绝句 其二","author":"华镇","text":"昔年同看杏园春，十载徒劳走路尘。\n试问风前拢板女，何如月下倚楼人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56188,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过永城寄知县陈宣德同年三绝句 其三","author":"华镇","text":"榆叶晚风愁去日，桃花春水喜归时。\n双凫犹在隋堤柳，准拟同看两岸丝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56189,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"海门道中望熟山寄知县朱宣德","author":"华镇","text":"一抹青山倚碧虚，遥知山下是仙居。\n东风桃叶堪乘兴，不畏长江畏简书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56190,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"叶县","author":"华镇","text":"双凫归去玉京游，尘满东风暗驿楼。\n唯有汝坟东逝水，春来依旧绿波流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56191,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郊原 其一","author":"华镇","text":"分苗刈麦满平田，缫茧声争涧水喧。\n我亦方怀三釜乐，暂逃尘鞅过郊原。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56192,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郊原 其二","author":"华镇","text":"晓来骑马出郊原，却忆年时此按田。\n流景已过三十里，如何容易又经年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56193,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"舟中昼寝同官陈尉见过从人不报起来以诗谢之","author":"华镇","text":"懒将心绪逐波流，攲枕蓬窗万虑休。\n贪逐化人游帝阙，不知梅福过扁舟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56194,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"六月旦有芝生于小厅之南楹连叶七层颜色黄润常有露珠联络其上观者叹息以为祥异因作三小诗 其一","author":"华镇","text":"黄金七叶向晨敷，人道曾标瑞应图。\n我已无心邀世福，不须三秀巧相谀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56195,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"六月旦有芝生于小厅之南楹连叶七层颜色黄润常有露珠联络其上观者叹息以为祥异因作三小诗 其二","author":"华镇","text":"品汇皆从化育成，无根神草为谁生。\n吾皇茂德参天地，好向甘泉植九重。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56196,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"六月旦有芝生于小厅之南楹连叶七层颜色黄润常有露珠联络其上观者叹息以为祥异因作三小诗 其三","author":"华镇","text":"芝英服食寿能千，蕊笈仙经每细看。\n久视长生吾不羡，任同凡草一时乾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56197,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"洛阳桥","author":"华镇","text":"壮年已熟洛阳名，今日亲来桥上行。\n叠石根盘连厚地，凌云气势压沧瀛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56198,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再经西禅寺二绝句 其一","author":"华镇","text":"我为人役走尘寰，僧老空门不出关。\n身世也知皆梦幻，到头忙者不如閒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56199,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再经西禅寺二绝句 其二","author":"华镇","text":"三时五度到西禅，春雪秋风暑湿天。\n试问经窗长宴坐，何如尘路走终年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56200,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"陶令","author":"华镇","text":"陶令当年亦萧索，犹来篱下醉流霞。\n闲门今日无人到，赖得寒丛未有花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56201,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"起工","author":"华镇","text":"龙骨穿云水上天，熊蟠抉地土成川。\n朝来泥淖漫胡处，日落星河已湛然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56202,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"会稽览古诗 其一 铁门限","author":"华镇","text":"铁限僧坊迹未移，千通真草了无遗。\n兰亭墨迹何由见，祇说萧郎奉使时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56203,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"会稽览古诗 其二 秦望山","author":"华镇","text":"秦人两世尽东游，辇路曾临到上头。\n睫在眼前终不见，不知登望竟何求。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56204,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"会稽览古诗 其三 樵风泾","author":"华镇","text":"碧山重叠水溶溶，南北朝来旦暮风。\n岩壑会稽真胜绝，樵苏犹是汉三公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56205,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"会稽览古诗 其四 城山","author":"华镇","text":"兵家制胜旧多门，赠答雍容亦解纷。\n缓报一双文锦鲤，坐归十万水犀军。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56206,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"会稽览古诗 其五 双笋石","author":"华镇","text":"千尺相高卓翠珉，雨馀云外露璘珣。\n鼎湖龙去苍髯断，三载丛花不记春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56207,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"会稽览古诗 其六 放马涧","author":"华镇","text":"春草茸茸涧水清，路人犹记昔时名。\n金羁纵后双蹄逸，想见风前蹀躞声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56208,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"会稽览古诗 其七 虞国墅","author":"华镇","text":"山列翠屏围碧落，水流鸣管绕平田。\n郗家池馆萝芜后，金谷形容自渺然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56209,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"会稽览古诗 其八 燕竹","author":"华镇","text":"竹箭黄芽欲老时，杏梁日煖燕初归。\n他林未耸千竿翠，此地先抽一握肥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56210,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闻酒香戏作","author":"华镇","text":"下蚓盈泉腹，高蝉溢露肠。\n如何不能饮，空羡瓮头香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56211,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郑相庙","author":"华镇","text":"鸣玉锵金汉上公，当年荣与旧君同。\n故山庙食千秋后，来往犹乘旦暮风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56212,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"葛仙翁钓台","author":"华镇","text":"闻说风流谢客儿，鸰原相应日鸣飞。\n仙翁遗迹云深处，携手行吟送落晖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56213,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"五云溪","author":"华镇","text":"万壑千岩秀气钟，鸣琴漱玉晓玲珑。\n瑞云重叠中书馆，花浪腾棱相国风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56214,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郑公泉","author":"华镇","text":"溪上清泉玉色寒，临泉蹋尽石苔斑。\n为怜北阙乘轩客，白首高情在旧山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56215,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"镜湖","author":"华镇","text":"水风不动清光合，十里浑无一点瑕。\n野客若寻湖上事，不须临水问荷花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56216,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"陈大夫宅","author":"华镇","text":"邻里相欢起美谈，通衢高柳碧鬖鬖。\n至今风俗称虞芮，目击岐周始自惭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56217,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"龙宫寺","author":"华镇","text":"盐梅器业尚风尘，书剑曾游寂寞滨。\n秀句玲珑满天下，应搜佳丽入机神。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56218,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"金庭洞天","author":"华镇","text":"嵩高秀入洛川清，鹤去云归冷玉笙。\n霜白金庭今夜月，流风依约有遗声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56219,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"桃源","author":"华镇","text":"嘉树风生玉宇香，莺飞燕舞弄春阳。\n归来井邑皆如旧，始觉仙家日月长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56220,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"瀑布岭","author":"华镇","text":"春日云崖晴杳杳，东风山溜晓泠泠。\n烟霞密迩神仙府，草木微滋亦有灵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56221,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戴溪","author":"华镇","text":"月华雪彩照长川，一叶扁舟破紫烟。\n十二瑶台登赏夜，清光长似昔时天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56222,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"会稽咏古","author":"华镇","text":"墨妙风流亘古今，等闲陈迹冠山阴。\n耳闻贞观求真迹，眼见天章照茂林。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56223,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"海门","author":"华镇","text":"海陵东去尽东隅，桑柘田闾间碧芦。\n北障海涛除斥卤，南分江水溉膏腴。\n人羞投牒论长短，俗喜乘航贸有无。\n林下每逢垂白叟，自言不识被追呼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56224,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"诗一首","author":"华镇","text":"尽日道途经曲直，连天林木见高低。\n况多田野迎秋稼，亦有人家报午鸡。\n宁觉身逾江尾外，祇疑地是海唇西。\n此心不解分明想，眼界多为近事迷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56225,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"玉蕊花","author":"华镇","text":"当年玉蕊冠京华，不独人间压万花。\n曾使瑶池冰雪手，亲来折向玉峰誇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56226,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晚宿张三馆","author":"华镇","text":"篮舆薄暮息烟村，回望葱葱认九门。\n自喜青楼无别恨，不妨孤馆欲黄昏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56227,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"部队","author":"华镇","text":"约束详明曲有伦，不防农事尚占春。\n解教乌合三千众，来往兴居似一人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56228,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"钓台","author":"华镇","text":"仙客乘槎学钓翁，劈波时跃锦鳞红。\n浮槎不到寒江上，松叶泠然自好风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56229,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"华镇","text":"汪芒后至知何用，败骨空专一素车。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56230,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"华镇","text":"南国使君归故里，霜鸿飞舞送朱轮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56231,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"华镇","text":"谢公白首乘轩地，长记沧波洗屐时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56232,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其四","author":"华镇","text":"六龙未入雍州日，曾负诗书卧白云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56233,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其五","author":"华镇","text":"君王旦暮方尝胆，犹筑池塘长紫鳞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56234,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"诗二首 其一","author":"种师道","text":"外塞胡儿里党臣，勾连数众赴京城。\n团团阔阔孤平寨，不识皇家王气星。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56235,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"诗二首 其二","author":"种师道","text":"飞蛾视火残生灭，燕逐群鹰命不存。\n从今一扫胡兵尽，万年不敢正南行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56236,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题惠山寺真赏亭流觞","author":"施大任","text":"惠山山半有飞泉，甃石环亭泛酒船。\n只任源流自亭下，不缘机智得方圆。\n夷犹小棹翻宾榻，零乱浮华出洞天。\n六月炎蒸应恋此，二松风韵更萧然。\n江帆远渡疏林外，山鸟闲吟落照边。\n盛世正逢元祐日，清欢重继永和年。\n萦心难效公垂咏，真赏尤知子美贤。\n我是林泉自由者，时时来作醉中仙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56237,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"白云亭","author":"安扶","text":"云来本无心，云去亦无迹。\n要是莫逆交，更为不速客。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56238,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"苏嘉","text":"衣冠晨集乌衣巷，旌旆春生绿野堂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56239,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"苏嘉","text":"铜符方拜新留守，竹马还迎旧使君。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56240,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题滴水岩","author":"席汝明","text":"塞上风埃扑眼多，飞泉欣见此岩阿。\n冰丝不断银潢脉，珠滴长圆月窟波。\n暂转杯觞闲屈曲，忽为霖雨下霶?。\n形容好景须诗笔，万古苍崖始一磨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56241,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题滴水岩","author":"常传正","text":"朦胧秋月助光辉，飘泊春风溅客衣。\n百尺水晶帘不捲，数峰巫峡雨长飞。\n羽觞脩禊行将近，蜡屐登山定不稀。\n自恨云岩迹如扫，仗君借眼瞩芳菲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56242,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送程给事知越州 其一","author":"毕仲连","text":"玉籍殊科四十秋，徊翔藩翰几淹留。\n五羊旧治功尤著，百越新恩志已酬。\n健节亭亭心益壮，清吟一一思如流。\n壶浆满道争迎处，昼锦应先驻虎邱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56243,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]